---
/** 연재 글 상단의 시리즈 목차. frontmatter에 series가 있는 글에서 BlogPost 레이아웃이 보여 줍니다. */
import { SERIES, type SeriesId } from '../consts';
import { getPublishedPosts } from '../lib/posts';

interface Props {
	id: SeriesId;
	current: string;
}
const { id, current } = Astro.props;
const series = SERIES[id];
const posts = (await getPublishedPosts())
	.filter((p) => p.data.series?.id === id)
	.sort((a, b) => a.data.series!.order - b.data.series!.order);
const label = (order: number) => (order === 0 ? '용어' : `${order}장`);
---

<nav class="series" aria-label={`${series.title} 시리즈`}>
	<p class="head">
		<span class="kicker">시리즈</span>
		{series.title}
		<span class="count">{posts.length}편</span>
	</p>
	<ol>
		{
			posts.map((p) => (
				<li>
					<a href={`/blog/${p.id}/`} aria-current={p.id === current ? 'page' : undefined}>
						<span class="no">{label(p.data.series!.order)}</span>
						<span class="t">{p.data.title}</span>
						{p.data.draft && <span class="draft">초안</span>}
					</a>
				</li>
			))
		}
	</ol>
</nav>

<style>
	.series {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
		padding: 16px 20px;
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 14px;
	}
	.head {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 10px;
		margin: 0 0 8px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--ink);
	}
	.kicker {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--ok);
	}
	.count {
		margin-left: auto;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	ol {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	a {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 12px;
		padding: 5px 8px;
		margin: 0 -8px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.93rem;
	}
	a:hover {
		background: var(--code-inline-bg);
	}
	a[aria-current] {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-weight: 650;
		background: var(--accent-soft);
	}
	.no {
		flex: 0 0 2.6em;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
	}
	a[aria-current] .no {
		color: inherit;
	}
	.draft {
		margin-left: auto;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--fail);
	}
</style>
